<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8" align="justify">
                <h3><b>Product Strategy, Prioritization, and Roadmap Planning</b></h3>

                <p>
                    Product strategy provides the foundation for prioritizing product
                    initiatives and building a roadmap. Strategic priorities should be
                    converted into actionable initiatives that teams can execute while
                    maintaining focus on customer and business outcomes.
                </p>

                <h5><b>Strategic Prioritization</b></h5>
                <p>
                    Evaluate initiatives based on customer value, business impact,
                    strategic alignment, effort, technical feasibility, risk, and market
                    opportunity.
                </p>

                <h5><b>Outcome-Based Roadmapping</b></h5>
                <p>
                    Build roadmaps around meaningful product outcomes rather than simply
                    listing features. This allows teams to remain flexible while keeping
                    the overall strategic direction clear.
                </p>

                <h5><b>Resource Alignment</b></h5>
                <p>
                    Align people, skills, budget, technology, and delivery capacity with
                    the most important strategic initiatives.
                </p>

                <h5><b>Regular Strategic Reviews</b></h5>
                <p>
                    Review product priorities and roadmap progress regularly to ensure
                    that execution remains aligned with current business and customer
                    needs.
                </p>
            </div>

